                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8"></span>
                                                            <span class="NormalTextRun SCXW5247660 BCX8">
                                                                Unlike other big cats, cheetahs don't roar. Instead, they chirp, purr, and use a sharp stutter bark - especially the males, 
                                                                who use it to attract females.
                                                            </span>
